        <Param val="You will now hear pairs of similar-sounding syllables which have been synthesized. In each pair, one version does not contain vocal fry at all and the other contains very strong vocal fry.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch where the arrow points and read the label, then click that spot on the scale. Once you’ve selected the highlighted spot, click Continue to move on to the next sound." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
